==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-au-hit the jackpot.ogg|a=AU}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|hit<,,hit> the jackpot}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} To [[receive]] a more [[favorable]] [[outcome]] than [[imagine]]d, especially by [[good luck]].
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2021 August 25|author=Richard Foster|title=The rise and fall of railway's Big Four...|journal=RAIL|issue=938|page=55|text=Before 1914, coal was a true cash-cow, and on paper, the GWR looked to have '''hit the jackpot''' by being handed all the railways in the South Wales coal fields.}}
# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} To be [[accurate]] or [[correct]].
# {{lb|@lit|en|hit|jackpot}}

